ur trial. Master the runes. Discover what lies beyond. But can you reach Ariah?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938190?t=1763111365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/7165b8397025d157f715236b7f686c75fd53f0e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763111365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/03afad3667395998c8c8d7b01dd7410a51329c9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763111365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/03afad3667395998c8c8d7b01dd7410a51329c9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763111365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3959510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/032d0c3a49d8c05f9490e64bdb39f92c.avif?t=1763111365\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/a52b92a1abc8b9caa287d67cf4b1c7fc.poster.avif?t=1763111365\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/a52b92a1abc8b9caa287d67cf4b1c7fc.webm?t=1763111365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938190/extras/a52b92a1abc8b9caa287d67cf4b1c7fc.mp4?t=1763111365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span